    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2 data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2457\">Level 14 — <strong data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2457\">Terror Charge</strong></h2><p data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2482\">Fear trails behind you.</p><h3 data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2506\">Mechanical Effects</h3><p data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2528\">While at <strong data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2527\">Burn 3+</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2718\"><li data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2590\"><p data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2590\">Creatures you hit must save or become <strong data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2590\">Shaken of you</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2718\"><p data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2619\">Shaken creatures have:</p><ul data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2718\"><li data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2671\"><p data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2671\">roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on opportunity attacks against you</p></li><li data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2718\"><p data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2718\">Reduced movement when moving away from you</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2735\">At <strong data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2734\">Burn 4+</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2811\"><li data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2811\"><p data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2811\">Nearby enemies (GM-defined radius) must save or hesitate (lose reactions)</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2886\">They are not afraid of dying.<br data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2845\" />They are afraid of watching you not stop.</p>",
